-- SellerOS — dev seed data
--
-- ⚠️ DEMO DATA ⚠️ Everything in this file is clearly marked demo data.
-- It exists so the app is usable immediately after `supabase db reset`.
-- It contains NO real credentials, secrets, or personal information.
--
-- To use it:
--   1. Create your own auth user via the Dashboard / Sign Up page.
--   2. Link it to the demo business:
--        insert into public.business_members (business_id, user_id, role)
--        values ('00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', '<your-auth-user-id>', 'owner');
--   3. Sign in — the dashboard shows the demo shop's data.
--
-- Or skip the demo business entirely and use the onboarding flow:
-- your first created business will be empty.


